\title{[I2] Exponentiation (3 pts)}
\date{2026-09-04T13:23:47Z}
\tag{algorithms}
\tag{problem}

\import{algorithms-macros}

\p{Write a recursive algorithm which, given a real number #{b} and a natural number #{e}, computes the power #{b^e}.  Prove that your algorithm is correct.}

\p{You may express your algorithm using appropriate [pseudocode](00KH), or you may implement it in a real programming language; either one is fine.  You may use addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division, but you may not use any kind of built-in exponentiation operation.}
